    <title>
        <en>Judith Plains, Montana 4X</en>
        <de>Judith Plains, Montana 4X</de>
        <ro>Câmpiile Judith River, Montana SUA 4X</ro>
    </title>
    <description>
        <en><![CDATA[Welcome to Judith Plains, Montana 4X

This fictional 4x map is inspired by central Montana, emphasizing agriculture and expansive landscapes.
It features multiple towns, a vast train system connecting two of them, and a route that begins in the highlands, winds through dense forests, and descends into the valley, covering a significant portion of the map.
Scattered bridges, two creeks, and a river cutting across the terrain add to the immersive experience.

Key Features:
New Crops: Alfalfa and Clover, mowable like grass, wrapable for silage and baled for animal feed.
Custom Harvestore Silo: Produces silage from grass, alfalfa, clover, and chaff (requires land ownership).
Inbuilt Corn Dryer: Converts Corn into DryCorn (requires land ownership).
New Straw Types: Corn and soybeans now produce cornstalks and bean straw, which can be baled to be sold or used as animal bedding.
Custom Productions: Whiskey, Beer, Wine, Ethanol, Soymilk, Pasta, Pizza, Cornoil, Cornflour.
Enhanced Crop Features:
Custom corn textures with stubble destruction.
Crop destruction effects added for all major crops.
Grass planted will now have seasonal color change effects.
Custom geo based on the Northern United States, featuring spring planting of wheat, barley, and canola, with extended harvest periods for corn, soybeans, sorghum, and sunflowers.
Expanded Terrain Options: Additional ground textures added for paint mode.
Custom Lighting: Orange sunrise/sunset and darker nights.
Land & Farming:
122 arable fields, ranging from medium to large, with a few meadows.
A Custom soil map included to support Precision Farming DLC.
All of the map can be purchasable. 
Custom Built Farms:
6 custom built farm areas scattered across map
7 empty land areas for players to build their own farms
Each farm have color themed barns, animal pens and silos
Custom buildings: 10 dairy barns, 6 sheep pastures, 2 pigsties,and 4 hen pens (requires land ownership).
Each farm have Custom Grain bin silos (requires land ownership).
Each farm have a separate Corn Dryer & Harvestor (requires land ownership).
Sell Points & Economy:
12 sell points with varying product acceptance.
3 Train silos and Train sell point included.
Bulk feed shop for seeds, lime, herbicide, fertilizer, anhydrous, and propane.
Added Realism:
Custom Montana license plates.
Anhydrous ammonia as a new fertilizer type.(Should work with any anhydrous applicator mods out there)
Propane added as a resource for productions.(Map includes modded tankers for transport)
Animal dealer have live animals at display.
Animated airplane flying over farms and the city. 
Two fire stations with animated doors and interiors.
Gas stations, Vehicle dealer with interiors.
Immersive Details:
John Deere dealership with demo equipment for players to borrow.
Custom environmental sounds and building smoke effects.
Multi-Terrain Angle (32 angles) for better field realism.
Performance: 
Completely error-free, with only minor, harmless warnings.
Enjoy farming in the Judith Plains, Montana!

Version 1.0.0.1:
Fixed issue where loading map in dedicated server gets struck at 100% compiling shaders. Updated the property type of store vehicles now so map works with Courseplay on Multiplayer]]></en>
